## Cursor workspace root

**/** = `c:/work/cursor/` — paths starting with `/` resolve here.

Bare paths (e.g. `docs/…`, `.cursor/…`) resolve under the **open workspace** (whichever project Cursor has open).

When workspace folder is a child repo, resolve siblings (e.g. `/authority/` → `../authority/` from `/double-click/`).

## Authority (global)

| Artifact | Path |
|----------|------|
| Repo | `/authority/` |
| Profile | `/authority/facts/profile/PROFILE.md` |
| Protocols | `/authority/protocols/` |
| Preferences | `/authority/preferences/` |
| Commands | `/authority/commands/` |
| Rules | `/authority/rules/` |

## Project (per repo)

Session content under **`docs/`** — not `.cursor/`.

| Artifact | Path |
|----------|------|
| Handoff | `docs/HANDOFF.md` |
| Overview | `docs/session/OVERVIEW.md` |
| Checklist | `docs/session/CHECKLIST.md` |
| Task | `docs/session/TASK.md` |
| Draft | `docs/session/DRAFT.md` |
| Minutes | `docs/minutes/YYYY-MM-DD.md` |
| Canonical design | `docs/DESIGN.md` (or project equivalent) |

Rules and commands (when installed): `.cursor/rules/`, `.cursor/commands/`.

## Boot / wrap

**Project-aware instructions live in HANDOFF** — read `docs/HANDOFF.md` boot/wrap sections before generic rule files.

Installed commands: `/authority/commands/`. DEV specs (manager): `/double-click/stubs/commands/`.

Minutes format: `/double-click/stubs/minutes.stub`.

Align stage spec: `/double-click/stubs/align.stub`.
